DESCRIPTION:Young Audiences of Houston offers family friendly\, live art experiences perfect for a wide variety of ages. These interactive workshops and performances last between 60 and 90 minutes and involve YAH artists and ensembles\, crossing genres of dance\, visual arts\, theater\, music\, and literary arts.
